# 📝 Real-Life Pointer Problems

## Problem 1: Update Employee Salary

```go
package main

import "fmt"

func updateSalary(salary *int) {
    *salary = 50000
}

func main() {
    salary := 40000

    updateSalary(&salary)

    fmt.Println("Salary =", salary)
}
```

---

## Problem 2: Increase Student Marks

```go
package main

import "fmt"

func addBonus(marks *int) {
    *marks += 5
}

func main() {
    marks := 90

    addBonus(&marks)

    fmt.Println("Marks =", marks)
}
```

### Output

```text
Marks = 95
```

---

## Problem 3: Swap Two Numbers

```go
package main

import "fmt"

func swap(a, b *int) {
    temp := *a
    *a = *b
    *b = temp
}

func main() {
    x := 10
    y := 20

    swap(&x, &y)

    fmt.Println(x)
    fmt.Println(y)
}
```

### Output

```text
20
10
```

